<title>UK: Freistaat Bayern sets 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Freistaat Bayern sets 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank, ABN AMRO, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p>BORROWER  *FREISTAAT BAYERN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    30.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.00 PCT PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*LANDESCHATZANWEISUNG JUMBO ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
